Third-Party Dependencies:

No third-party source code is vendored into this repository. All of its
contents are original works of Tenstorrent USA, Inc. The dependencies listed
below are resolved at install time (Python) or link time (OpenSSL) and are not
redistributed with this project.

Required at runtime:

  cryptography            Apache License 2.0 OR BSD 3-Clause License
                          https://github.com/pyca/cryptography

  ruamel.yaml             MIT License
                          https://sourceforge.net/projects/ruamel-yaml/

Optional, for AWS KMS signing (the "aws" extra):

  boto3                   Apache License 2.0
                          https://github.com/boto/boto3

Development and testing only (the "dev" extra):

  pytest                  MIT License
                          https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest

  pytest-cov              MIT License
                          https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest-cov

Build and test only, for the host-side validator CLI under validators/oca/:

  OpenSSL 3               Apache License 2.0
                          https://www.openssl.org/

The specification PDF build (make spec-pdf) additionally requires asciidoctor
and asciidoctor-pdf (both MIT License), which are invoked as external tools and
contribute no code to the rendered output.
